#
# wsys' theme (wsys(4)), 9space's: acme's colours on rio's grey desktop.
# Taken from 9front: acme's (/sys/src/cmd/acme/acme.c, iconinit: its tag's
# DPalebluegreen mixed with white, DPalegreygreen, DPurpleblue; its text's
# DPaleyellow mixed with white, DDarkyellow, DYellowgreen; but2col
# #aa0000, but3col #006600; DMedblue; /sys/include/draw.h's values) and
# rio's background #777777 (/sys/src/cmd/rio/data.c). Copyright © 2021
# Plan 9 Foundation, Copyright © 20XX 9front authors; MIT, /lib/legal/mit.
# The dark palette and the other colours are 9space's.
# Text on acme's pale yellow with its darker yellow selection; controls,
# menus and text boxes on acme's pale blue-green (its tag); the current
# window's border in acme's purple-blue, the scroll bar its yellow-green;
# danger and success acme's button 2 red and button 3 green. Light and
# dark: "mode dark" (or "echo mode dark >/dev/theme") chooses the dark
# palette, the dark.* lines (acme's hues, dimmed). Text has 12:1 or more
# against its window, every colour of text 6.2:1 or more.
